  "description": "General surgery resident Yoon Hae-Soo has always focused on paying off her father's debt and becoming a great surgeon. But after CEO Chae Ji-Seok enters the ER as a VIP patient, her world is completely turned upside down. Not only does he want her to be his only doctor, Ji-Seok wants to spend every second with her. Hae-Soo can't understand why a stranger would be so interested in her, but she also feels strangely attracted to him. Little does she know that this isn't their first time meeting...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
